	(text "Pin map: P0.28/AIN4 = I_SENSE, P0.03/AIN1 = VIN_SENSE, P1.13 = MOTOR_PWM, P0.31/P0.29 = UART TX/RX,\nP0.05 = button, P0.24 = LED (active low). Use internal pull-up on P0.05. P0.02 unused.\nVDDH tied to VDD (normal-voltage mode), DCCH and XL1/XL2 open. Only outer module pads are used (hand soldering).\nCeramic antenna at the board edge: no copper under it; keep metal parts of the grinder away from it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.41 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0364ea92-e86f-4cfc-a38d-5cb51be5ee07")
	)
	(text "Q2 is logic-level: driven directly from P1.13 (use GPIO high-drive). R5 keeps the motor OFF during reset.\nRun on/off, or PWM <= ~4 kHz for soft-start.  D3 = flyback diode.\nI_SENSE = I_motor x 10 mR x 100 = 1 V/A (~3.2 A full scale). Measured: 0.5 A avg, 0.95 A peak.\nLayout: run U3 IN+/IN- as a separate pair straight from R6's pads (Kelvin)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "041934bc-ee54-4666-b893-ddd0e4ab41a2")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.7 154.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
